Description	"B1-series Flame Battle Droid

Battle Droids specializing in incendiary support.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- CR-24 Flame Rifle (Flamethrower)
-- 50% slower mag reload
- Fire Grenades (3)

^6Inventory:
- Assault Sentry ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 10% less knockback taken
- Fuel Regen (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Getup (2)
- Elemental Resist (1)
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
-- Burns on hit
-- 50% less damage"